# Phase 3.5 CLI acceptance — index verification job (W3, D-3.5-09).
#
# The index verify job is enqueue-only (D-13): the command enqueues the job
# and returns the job id; it never blocks on the job's completion.

```console
$ qai quran index verify-job
queued index verification job [..] for index quran.ayah.v1 (deep: false)

```

```console
$ qai quran index verify-job --deep
queued index verification job [..] for index quran.ayah.v1 (deep: true)

```

```console
$ qai quran index verify-job --index quran.ayah.v1
queued index verification job [..] for index quran.ayah.v1 (deep: false)

```
